        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Beyond SWS and OCTG products, we also offer premium threading services in five of the six jurisdictions in which we operate, which five jurisdictions are Indonesia, Malaysia, Thailand, Brunei and Singapore.",
        "start_character": 5562,
        "end_character": 5768
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-282941",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-282941-4b9f9ad58f385d86",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-282941",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By having our own design and products in-house, we are able to improve our service, supply chain and costs.",
        "start_character": 36962,
        "end_character": 37069
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-282941",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-282941-4b9f9ad58f385d86",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-282941",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-25",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Currently, all of our operating subsidiaries, with the exception of Saudi Arabia, maintain these premium connection licenses, enabling us to provide our customers with premium threading-related services and support in all six jurisdictions in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 22920,
        "end_character": 23180
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-282941",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-282941-4b9f9ad58f385d86",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-282941",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-25",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our products are also exported to jurisdictions outside of those in which we operate, including countries in North and West Africa.",
        "start_character": 5430,
        "end_character": 5561
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-282941",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-282941-4b9f9ad58f385d86",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-282941",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Some areas where we are exploring the possibility of growing our product portfolio are in power generation, mini hydro development, biomass and other renewable opportunities.",
